@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@csrf = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_CSRF
@session = REPLACE_WITH_SESSION_COOKIE

### Read the current provider catalog and deployment version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/operator/model-providers
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}

### Save OpenRouter and fetch its model IDs, capacity and token/cache prices
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/operator/model-providers
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "name": "OpenRouter",
  "type": "openrouter",
  "baseUrl": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1",
  "apiKey": "REPLACE_WITH_API_KEY"
}

### New API: replace version, endpoint and billing group with the key's actual group
### Pricing is fetched anonymously from the same server's public /api/pricing.
### If that endpoint is unavailable, the model list still saves with unknown prices.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/operator/model-providers
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 2,
  "name": "Self-hosted New API",
  "type": "newapi",
  "baseUrl": "https://newapi.example.com/v1",
  "pricingGroup": "default",
  "apiKey": "REPLACE_WITH_API_KEY"
}

### Select a chat model; blank overrides use saved metadata and provider context handling
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/workspaces/REPLACE_WORKSPACE_ID/models
Origin: {{baseUrl}}
Cookie: repodesk_session={{session}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "revision": 0,
  "selection": {
    "providerId": "REPLACE_WITH_PROVIDER_UUID",
    "model": "REPLACE_WITH_DISCOVERED_MODEL_ID",
    "thinkingLevel": "off"
  }
}

### Optional modelPricing overrides: input, output, cacheRead and cacheWrite.
### Prices default to USD / million tokens; non-USD requires a positive usdRate.
### Provider edits fetch metadata again; existing runs retain pinned prices.
### DeepSeek's modelPriceTier may be "peak" (default) or "off_peak" for estimates.
